 [1221]={["complex"]=true,["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Grab a Crate with Holes.\010Grab a Snufflenose Command Stick.\010Grab and read the Snufflenose Owner's Manual.\010In Razorfen Kraul, use the Crate with Holes to summon a Snufflenose Gopher, and use the Command Stick on the gopher to make it search for Tubers.\010Bring 6 Blueleaf Tubers, the Snufflenose Command Stick and the Crate with Holes to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."},
