 [1365]={["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Bring Khan Dez'hepah's Head to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace."},
 [1366]={["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace."},
 [1367]={["complex"]=true,["extra"]={"Slay Gelkis centaur to increase your reputation with the Magram Clan"},["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Magram, then speak with Warug.\010Slay Gelkis centaur to increase your reputation with the Magram Clan"},
