 [2930]={["complex"]=true,["extra"]={"Step 1: obtain the Yellow Punch Card. You need the White Punch Card.","Step 2: obtain the Blue Punch Card. You need the Yellow Punch Card.","Step 3: obtain the Red Punch Card. You need the Blue Punch Card.","Step 4: obtain the Prismatic Punch Card. You need the Red Punch Card."},["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.\010Step 1: obtain the Yellow Punch Card. You need the White Punch Card.\010Step 2: obtain the Blue Punch Card. You need the Yellow Punch Card.\010Step 3: obtain the Red Punch Card. You need the Blue Punch Card.\010Step 4: obtain the Prismatic Punch Card. You need the Red Punch Card."},
