 [79361]={["source"]="QuestieDB Forever",["text"]="Collect 5 Twisted Fire Totems, 5 Twisted Earth Totems, 5 Twisted Air Totems, and 5 Twisted Water Totems for Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles."},
